{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eabe427c4ce1e03dabd8edaff61f4b6b86857c81d10b9f91deacc76577feca1b", "ja": "（いよいよ初公演……さすがの麗花も、\n緊張しているに違いない。どうほぐしたものか……）", "zh": "（首次公演快开始了……就算是丽花，\n想必也十分紧张。我要怎么帮助她放松呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2cea08b29cfc7a014d8e2f3f522fef60dca8c579bf32d45a0dccf4f58dda264a", "ja": "えっ！？\nと、突然前が暗くなった……！？", "zh": "哇！？\n眼、眼前突然一片漆黑……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "17cddf82c7464580feb8270e768f5ec0575daef7d5d6af7fe74bc48e3c5f2733", "ja": "ふふっ。だーれだ？", "zh": "呵呵，猜猜我是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f90cff82b158b85570d885df2adb1ba3f8f8010ae012b70f873740792f366b05", "ja": "（この声は……）", "zh": "（这声音是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_1004", "source_sha256": "a49063d9b246028e59e64abf18c645bf0ba1d54a052bfa3bdf0cfe859e8f3510", "ja": "麗花！", "zh": "丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "997a8e70590c3e622f75d9515c8fc738a1762ff5f4588fcbfbf68e3d4d993f68", "ja": "麗花だろ？\n自分が担当してるアイドルの声くらい、わかるよ。", "zh": "你是丽花吧？\n你是我负责培育的偶像，我当然认得出你的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "004c41d9606bda6fa358e486af25c804570b44a006475f7a108fabe400e1c621", "ja": "ぱんぱかぱーん、大正解！\n1ポイントゲットです、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "锵锵锵锵～答对了！\n恭喜你得到1分，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "641314f16548f7a7d16561e3753e536bbf7ed2147f7bc888008616b12b3fa6f1", "ja": "はは……公演を控えているのに、相変わらずだな。\n緊張してないのか？", "zh": "哈哈……公演就快开始了，还是一样胡闹。\n你不紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2003_048rei", "source_sha256": "eb0209ba66a6108e52f8f37c5a2fb106e9e5f320bb73be8282d9fa5528abab2b", "ja": "私、緊張するというのがよくわからなくて。\nいつも通りですから、多分してないと思います！", "zh": "我不太清楚紧张是什么感觉。\n但现在感觉跟平时没两样，所以应该不紧张吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f164b1bd3ac89db30dd2260c56b7cdbc06826ece34bfaad7f0c37576062b29bd", "ja": "そ、そうか。それは頼もしい……。\n頼もしすぎて、逆に俺が不安になるくらいだよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊，真让人放心……\n放心到我反而快担心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2005_048rei", "source_sha256": "dfc28d36f88853596b932af92af6b8d977fdb6c9b97b3ae9c1ec81c70bcedb13", "ja": "あれれ？\n{$P$}さん、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "咦咦咦？\n{$P$}先生，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a02b0546cb14e452d00854bb325e5dce6ce3b836ab26da94206fe6793409dfdb", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫。\n麗花こそ、本当に大丈夫か？", "zh": "我没事，不用担心。\n丽花，你确定真的没问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2007_048rei", "source_sha256": "5cdf78897a71e168abdcd01610be6a1707ce3a66a17081b8aa23953e17b68eb9", "ja": "はい、本当に本当に大丈夫です！\nフェリーに乗ったつもりで、どーんと任せてください♪", "zh": "是的，我真的真的没问题哦！\n丽花办事，你可以放两百四十个心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2008_048rei", "source_sha256": "212b042de24372d49f39743be77b2c00ca23f063d8a24f93edf67201fc9a6771", "ja": "ではでは、行ってきますの、ぎゅーっ♪", "zh": "好啦好啦，我要出发啰，抱紧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "3f0dcb28ce42901a25614ab54b81650c0cc05a7ac35b49a53dab1eca0d9a78a9", "ja": "えっ？　う、うわっ！？\n麗花、抱きつくのはちょっと……！", "zh": "咦？呜、呜哇！？\n丽花，这样抱我不太好啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2010_048rei", "source_sha256": "314ac31a44eb19b13a79bdce286a892aaabd20db3c3272a52e0bcd497a6036ed", "ja": "ふふっ、元気出ちゃいました！\n{$P$}さんも、元気出ましたか？", "zh": "呵呵，我打起精神了！\n{$P$}先生，你也打起精神了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2011_p", "source_sha256": "e62c81eb8934ee5cbe2c59995d6b2323005e597326cbbce49214998203b2e7c7", "ja": "……はは。おかげさまで、元気が出たよ。\nありがとうな、麗花。", "zh": "……哈哈，多亏了你，我也打起精神了。\n谢谢你，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2012_048rei", "source_sha256": "97b519504209518c7ab773630a1ca67609357fd763c986da6c84c8b3901047a9", "ja": "こちらこそ！　私も、{$P$}さんの\n笑顔のおかげで、素敵な歌が歌えそうです♪", "zh": "彼此彼此！我也很感谢{$P$}先生，\n看到你的笑容，待会应该能唱得很棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2013_048rei", "source_sha256": "8582dfe6a4a5700b83b886dd8d736071b4234e10850e807f36e2cde5b9da72a8", "ja": "ステージから見える景色って、どんな感じかな？\nお客さんの笑顔を想像するだけで、ワクワクします♪", "zh": "不知道在舞台上会看到什么样的景色呢？\n光是想像观众的笑容，我就觉得好期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "19f6110534903cf88b9c1856739c8d518d1e0d678ebb7b1a82e98c81d8f6543b", "ja": "そうだな……\nきっと麗花にとって、すごくいいものだと思うよ。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n我想丽花你一定会很喜欢那副景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2015_048rei", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "是呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2016_048rei", "source_sha256": "87f3e831a618dd6a0cb38dafc47171a4e586d8fa77f92f90d901f411ea90832f", "ja": "{$P$}さんと頑張った日々の成果、\nしっかり出してきますから。見守っててくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我们每天努力的成果\n一定会彻底发挥出来。请你在旁边看好啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2017_048rei", "source_sha256": "b16411d0541239184551cdff3fde85d64a4f45af33a0c720a9e70c9ae7063dfb", "ja": "あ……そうだ！　あとひとつ！", "zh": "啊……对了！还有一件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2018_p", "source_sha256": "3cfadef5d888dc8987186ec62cce26c34447cd01d6ea925e406e440f6d9b964f", "ja": "まだ、何かあったのか？", "zh": "还有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2019_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f05fe69c695d0c95b3d3b2b4a1e1e9eb456d6c3176bb53be41cefd5221e787b", "ja": "はい！　ライブが終わったら、\n一緒に写真を撮ってもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "就是！演唱会结束之后，\n可以和我一起拍张照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2020_048rei", "source_sha256": "69a71dbcbfef02a1ecb2f31cdddaa0dce9b6eeff196e7472b32c004bc52b66b9", "ja": "せっかくの初ライブですし。今度は合成じゃない、\n{$P$}さんとの写真がほしいなって！", "zh": "难得的首次演唱会，我希望这次不要用合成的，\n要和{$P$}先生一起拍张合照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2021_p", "source_sha256": "62c38fb3ccc6d7597c06d2d9eedc13726656ab8b9f2a3bd7b26855504a0c071b", "ja": "……喜んで。\n笑顔を用意して待ってるよ。", "zh": "……我当然乐意。\n我会准备好笑容等你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2022_048rei", "source_sha256": "95ecb6a4550e11a8b494145a372a77b7736105e3b934e815902269e0e87e66ef", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます♪\nそれでは、今度こそ……行ってきます！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你♪\n那么，这次我真的……要出发啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2023_p", "source_sha256": "1b336f6b06f7bd135fd9ba500ce071181839506cfa78431beefd545b5c72c27f", "ja": "（笑顔を残してステージに向かって駆けていく、\nその背中は喜びに満ちている……）", "zh": "（最后她留下笑容冲向舞台，\n背影散发出满满的喜悦……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_003_2024_p", "source_sha256": "bb7b0b939045646e066be551082c85983cdd31de97ba56e3d27c7a1e9aa54173", "ja": "（今日のステージは、お客さんにとっても\n麗花にとっても、忘れられない1日になるだろう！）", "zh": "（今天的表演，不管是对观众还是对丽花来说，\n肯定都会是毕生难忘的日子吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
